{"version":1,"key":"card:233","content":{"id":233,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"剩余参数是将多个独立的参数合并为一个数组，而展开运算符则相反，向一个数组展开为一个个独立的参数。一些需要借助 apply 方法传递参数的方案现在可以使用展开运算符替代了。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3ba52ba7-d3ff-49a6-8be7-cf0980238906","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"例如对于 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"Math.max","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 方法，该方法接收多个数字参数，返回其最大值，当参数的个数比较少时可以还算容易使用，当需要比较的参数较多时，一般我们会将参数放置在一个数组中然后传入，但是 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"Math.max","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 不接收数组，它只接收一个个独立的参数","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"cdcd6172-5d03-4d1c-b7af-0549e6c09b01","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"Math.max([1, 3, 5, 4]); // ❌\nMath.max(1, 3, 5, 4);   // ✅","collabId":"9a953828-03db-40a1-b4fb-b97c7dc55c69","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"28b9951c-ad7b-457c-a792-3aaa858d3e1f","language":"JavaScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"afcc4c0e-ef72-4a0b-8d39-69d6bb2765d5"},{"children":[{"text":"我们通过会借助于 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"apply","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 方法，因为 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"apply","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 方法是将方法的参数合并为数组传入的","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"4b90a75c-462b-4f7c-a0f0-0a676c232dfb","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"Math.max.apply(Math, [1, 3, 5, 4]);","collabId":"b330d082-2cb0-460b-8271-4cd16412af45","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"0e13b864-7183-4f94-9b28-911f9ceb69a4","language":"JavaScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"0dc46869-949e-4a78-add5-8c992af65fbf"},{"children":[{"text":"在 ES6 中提供了展开运算符，可以直接将数组展开为一个个的独立参数进行传入","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d534f6ce-cf54-423a-b51b-0dcafd915db1","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"Math.max(...[1, 3, 5, 4]);","collabId":"a229bce5-1b64-4763-9545-6d6d43e33a14","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"6eb9dc86-8ab2-4b04-a103-692e7550c9bb","language":"JavaScript","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"bfedd191-1503-4310-a569-c6971e8318b2"},{"children":[{"text":"相比于 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"apply","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，写法上更加清晰，而且有的时候会将 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"apply","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 和 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"call","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 混淆，有记忆的负担。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"276c7aee-b318-4a64-b0af-8026021ed96e","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"tags":["JavaScript"],"createTime":1690901823920,"updateTime":1793532520570,"linkedCards":[{"id":227,"target":{"key":"card:227","type":"card","id":227},"summary":"我们可以使用 ... 对集合进行展开 const arr = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]; const set = new Set([1, 2, 3, 4, 5]); const map = new Map([['a', 1], ['b...","tags":["JavaScript"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532520570}}